{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted","id":1339545,"title":"Yu Yu Hakusho and Exalted?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-05T00:51:21-07:00","id":1339545,"title":"Yu Yu Hakusho and Exalted?","content":"Hello all, I was just wondering how you would create the main characters?<br /> <br /> -Hiei: Abyssal? (Likely an Infernal when we get that book...)<br /> -Kurama: Wood Aspect Dragonblood<br /> -Yusuke: Solar? Sidereal?<br /> -Kazama: Solar flat out...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-05T01:26:14-07:00","id":1339546,"title":"","content":"Kurama is flat out a Lunar... flat out.<br /> <br /> Yeah Heie should be an infernal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-05T05:13:51-07:00","id":1339572,"title":"","content":"Like most shonen protagonists who are Just That Good, I\u2019d probably peg Yusuke as a Solar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T00:57:23-07:00","id":1339779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339546#post1339546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kurama is flat out a Lunar... flat out. Yeah Heie should be an infernal.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree that he is very likely a Lunar however, his plant stuff that really make me think Wood Aspect Dragonblooded. Although I can also definitely see a No Moon Sorcerer with a strong plant focus for his spells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T01:46:39-07:00","id":1339783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339779#post1339779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I agree that he is very likely a Lunar however, his plant stuff that really make me think Wood Aspect Dragonblooded. Although I can also definitely see a No Moon Sorcerer with a strong plant focus for his spells.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I was thinking Sorcerer. Rose whip could be achieved with Wooddragons claw or a variant at least. And he probably could have Evocations from Artifacts.<br /> <br /> One of the types of entities I use in my games is Devas reincarnated into mortal babies, and this is literally what Kurama is. He seems to be one of those 2nd Circle souls that matured into a 3rd Circle. If I recall Dukantha\u2019s ship is supposed to one day become a 3rd Circle Soul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T07:13:56-07:00","id":1339832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339783#post1339783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah I was thinking Sorcerer. Rose whip could be achieved with Wooddragons claw or a variant at least. And he probably could have Evocations from Artifacts.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with you that considering how Kurama's plant powers all spring from Rose Whip, Sorcery with Wood Dragon's Claw as control spell (to develop Evocations for) could cover that base handily.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339783#post1339783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the types of entities I use in my games is Devas reincarnated into mortal babies, and this is literally what Kurama is. He seems to be one of those 2nd Circle souls that matured into a 3rd Circle. If I recall Dukantha\u2019s ship is supposed to one day become a 3rd Circle Soul.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No offense Eldagusto, but I think that might be some fanon conflation of Kimbery's Dawn with Lintha Ng Oroo, actually. Never heard of anything like demonic souls changing position in their peculiar hierarchies like that. If there is, i would like to read on that - could you point a reference to such a thing?<br /> <br /> <br /> Yusuke <i>could </i>be seen as a solar who turns out Infernal in the end run. Or the Yokai heritage and related powers might be treated in a way like Mara's demonic tattoos, that may open a set of evocations to those branded with them. Depends on one's preferences, though Solar with a demon-themed artifact is probably the much more convenient path overall though the history of Raizen's &quot;preparations&quot; and his possession of Urameshi during the fight with Sensui could be used to justify either.<br /> <br /> <br /> Now speaking of Kazuma Kuwabara..... sidereal.<br /> <br /> Yeah, when you really look at it, part of the joke with him is that <a href=\"https://yuyuhakusho.fandom.com/wiki/Kazuma_Kuwabara#Powers_and_Abilities\" target=\"_blank\">Kazuma's actual powerset</a> diverges considerably from his temperament, involving far more precognitive, enhanced awareness and even some healing capacity. Spirit Sword could be an artifact with evocations - or the spell of the same name as a control spell with evocations.<br /> <br /> Not that doing him as a Solar would be bad, but it crossed my mind that he is far more of a support/working on the sidelines/guide kind of guy than his pseudo-delinquent attitude might lead one to believe and from this came my view of him as sidereal. Just my two cents of thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-30-2020, 03:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T07:33:40-07:00","id":1339836,"title":"","content":"Actually, Kimbery's Dawn <i>was</i> a Second Circle Demon that was going to give rise to a new Third Circle for Kimbery; it's just that she was remade into a ship to serve Dukantha, so that's not very likely to happen now.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Also the Lintha island fortress Ng Ooru isn't a demon - it's a behemoth.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T12:58:56-07:00","id":1339888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339832#post1339832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I agree with you that considering how Kurama's plant powers all spring from Rose Whip, Sorcery with Wood Dragon's Claw as control spell (to develop Evocations for) could cover that base handily.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> No offense Eldagusto, but I think that might be some fanon conflation of Kimbery's Dawn with Lintha Ng Oroo, actually. Never heaard of anything like demonic souls changing position in their peculiar hierarchies like that. If there is, i would like to read on that - could you point a reference to such a thing?<br /> <br /> <br /> Yusuke <i>could </i>be seen as a solar who turns out Infernal in the end run. Or the Yokai heritage and related powers might be treated in a way like Mara's demonic tattoos, that may open a set of evocations to those branded with them. Depends on one's preferences, though Solar with a demon-themed artifact is probably the much more convenient path overall though the history of Raizen's &quot;preparations&quot; and his possession of Urameshi during the fight with Sensui could be used to justify either.<br /> <br /> <br /> Now speaking of Kazuma Kuwabara..... sidereal.<br /> <br /> Yeah, when you really look at it, part of the joke with him is that <a href=\"https://yuyuhakusho.fandom.com/wiki/Kazuma_Kuwabara#Powers_and_Abilities\" target=\"_blank\">Kazuma's actual powerset</a> diverges considerably from his temperament, involving far more precognitive, enhanced awareness and even some healing capacity. Spirit Sword could be an artifact with evocations - or the spell of the same name as a control spell with evocations.<br /> <br /> Not that doing him as a Solar would be bad, but it crossed my mind that he is far more of a support/working on the sidelines/guide kind of guy than his pseudo-delinquent attitude mmight lead one to believe and from this came my view of him as sidereal. Just my two cents of thought.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Kimbery's Dawn is a progenitive 2nd circle soul. Notice it isn't one of the standard 7 2nd Circle Soul types, 2nd edition, I want to say Roll of Glorious Divinininity, states Progenerative souls are theorized to be 2nd Circle Souls that become 3rd Circle Souls.<br /> <br /> The reincarnation thing is a specific headcanon for me, the Progenitive soul is not, its a thing.<br /> <br /> And I don't see why Kimbery's Dawn Being a boat stops its fate, its still a demon and a progenitive soul.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I do think Kuwabara would be Sidereal. He could be a Chosen of Mars as he is all about being truculent. Or maybe a chosen of Secrets as his family intuition is a major factor his character revolves around.<br /> <br /> <br /> I would say Yusuke is an Abyssal, he was Exalted from the Brink of Death and polices the Underworld. Lets say he is an Abyssal working for the Celestial Bureaucracy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T13:15:28-07:00","id":1339894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339888#post1339888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Kimbery's Dawn is a progenitive 2nd circle soul. Notice it isn't one of the standard 7 2nd Circle Soul types, 2nd edition, I want to say Roll of Glorious Divinininity, states Progenerative souls are theorized to be 2nd Circle Souls that become 3rd Circle Souls.<br /> <br /> The reincarnation thing is a specific headcanon for me, the Progenitive soul is not, its a thing.<br /> <br /> And I don't see why Kimbery's Dawn Being a boat stops its fate, its still a demon and a progenitive soul.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, the progenitive soul thing - yeah, it could be. Or it could be &quot;just&quot; a title pointing to her role as mother of the Eristrufa (that in 1e were implied to have an additional, secret form that might be mistaken for a Fae - or pure-blood lintha) and possible connection to Lintha fortunes. Could go either way, i guess.<br /> <br /> Well, acording to examples as hellstriders and other stuff, yes, <b><i>being turned in an artifact means pretty much game over</i></b> to one's role in demonic hierarchy, but that was 2e, so it could certainly change. That said, making oneself satelite to an Akuma <i>does </i>seem like strange behaviour for one with supposed potential/fate to evolve into a 3rd Circle Soul....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339888#post1339888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say Yusuke is an Abyssal, he was Exalted from the Brink of Death and polices the Underworld. Lets say he is an Abyssal working for the Celestial Bureaucracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I never thought about it like that, but it could certainly work, an abyssal with little to no awareness of its patrons coopted by Endings and would also go well with Enma's plan of preemptively eliminating him on his &quot;2nd death&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T13:30:52-07:00","id":1339899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339894#post1339894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, the progenitive soul thing - yeah, it could be. Or it could be &quot;just&quot; a title pointing to her role as mother of the Eristrufa (that in 1e were implied to have an additional, secret form that might be mistaken for a Fae - or pure-blood lintha) and possible connection to Lintha fortunes. Could go either way, i guess.<br /> <br /> Well, acording to examples as hellstriders and other stuff, yes, <b><i>being turned in an artifact means pretty much game over</i></b> to one's role in demonic hierarchy, but that was 2e, so it could certainly change. That said, making oneself satelite to an Akuma <i>does </i>seem like strange behaviour for one with supposed potential/fate to evolve into a 3rd Circle Soul....<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I never thought about it like that, but it could certainly work, an abyssal with little to no awareness of its patrons coopted by Endings and would also go well with Enma's plan of preemptively eliminating him on his &quot;2nd death&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well they specifically call out Kimbary's Dawn and the mysterious 8th Second Circle type of Progenitive soul. But Kimbary's Dawn doesn't seem to be an Artifact to me, its a Demon that is a boat. I don't remember what its history was before Dukantha, was it stated to look different and not always a boat? But either way its a Demon that is a boat. If Demons can chasms and Dojos I don't see why being a boat is a no no. Sorry my books are disorganized right now and not easily accessible.<br /> <br /> I would Like a division of the Bureaucracy, maybe tied to Endings or maybe something else, started to be developed to bring the Underworld and Malfeas and outside places like the Wyld into the purview of Heaven and Fate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T14:11:34-07:00","id":1339913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339899#post1339899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well they specifically call out Kimbary's Dawn and the mysterious 8th Second Circle type of Progenitive soul. But Kimbary's Dawn doesn't seem to be an Artifact to me, its a Demon that is a boat. I don't remember what its history was before Dukantha, was it stated to look different and not always a boat? But either way its a Demon that is a boat. If Demons can chasms and Dojos I don't see why being a boat is a no no. Sorry my books are disorganized right now and not easily accessible.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was going to point out that behaviour-wise she's not exactly different in manifestations of behaviour from Hellstriders or other infernal artifacts with a degree of setience, but then remembered that, yeah, she <b>is </b>adressed in terms of 2nd circle terminology, implying that unlike on their case, her spiritual link to Kimbery is not gone, making her a special, unique case. Though the fact one can't, iirc, summon her through 2nd circle sorcery, with or without Dukantha, seems to run counter to this.<br /> <br /> Or, just a case of early instalment weirdness, as both write-ups of Kimbery's Dawn were done before we got MoEP: Infernals rules on demonic artifacts.<br /> Honestly, it could go either way in 3e and while we get no update of her or Dukantha it's wholy up to ST fiat.<br /> <br /> But the fluff doesn't make a good case for her as incumbent 3rd Circle, quite the contrary in fact.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339545-yu-yu-hakusho-and-exalted?p=1339899#post1339899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would Like a division of the Bureaucracy, maybe tied to Endings or maybe something else, started to be developed to bring the Underworld and Malfeas and outside places like the Wyld into the purview of Heaven and Fate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Attempting such an undertaking for only <b>one </b>of these three realms of existence (<i>definitely </i>not Malfeas due to the sheer diplomatic-sorcerous slippery slope of a rigmarole that would be) could make for a quite awesome Sidereal campaign indeed. The sheer politicking such a insanely monumental project might call for. Damn, Creation might be in too much of a mess currently for Yu-shan to even consider such a thing. That said, it could be a great way to offer new opportunities for all those unemployed gods....<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><i>*<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Age_of_Discovery\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Exploration</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colonialism\" target=\"_blank\">Colonialism</a> feelings incoming*</i></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-30-2020, 10:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T14:43:30-07:00","id":1339922,"title":"","content":"If she is in the periphery of the 2nd and 3rd Circle it makes sense that she starts to not be confined by 2nd Circle limitations. If I get the book quote I'll post it.<br /> <br /> But I don't see her used as an artifact, she is a boat by nature so naturally she is inclined to treated as an item, but she was also given a mission by Kimbery, I mean didn't she ferry the Exaltation Tithe to the Yozis?<br /> <br /> She seems more independent then the Hellstriders mentioned, but she is partners with Dukantha.<br /> <br /> I would wager you can't summon the Wasp of Octavian with Summon Demon of the First Circle in 3rd ed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T19:31:02-07:00","id":1339979,"title":"","content":"Well, you don't summon a <i>specific</i> First Circle Demon with the spell in Ex3 anyway. You just summon <i>a</i> demon of that species; if you want a Blood Ape that knows Tiger Style, or a literate Neomah, you'd probably accomplish it better via a Working (or teaching Charms if that's your bag).<br /> <br /> \u200bBut that doesn't really say anything about <i>Kimbery's Dawn</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T19:44:22-07:00","id":1339981,"title":"","content":"Genkai very much a Sidereal mentor. I mean she's literally introduced as knowing a technique that is supposed to make one significantly more powerful, fits SMAs nicely. Actually I can kind of see Sids doing that from time to time pretending to be some old master of a style seeking a worthy pupil to pass on the techniques they've spent a lifetime mastering, possibly literally near the end of their life or just a thing they do every once in a while to draw out those that would benefit from knowing the styles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3400,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","user":"nalak42","date":".  Wrong g character name 10-06-2019, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T22:23:39-07:00","id":1340547,"title":"","content":"I actually was going to use the YYH cast as NPCs in a Solars game once. Genkai was a chosen of Endings who had been around since pre-Usurpation. Kurama was a chosen of Secrets, and her right hand. Hiei was a chosen of Battles that had originally sided with the Bronze faction, but was murdered by Chejop or Anys Syn for being too radical, and he remembered his own murder and hooked up with Kurama and Genkai to get revenge. Kuwabara would have been Serenity, and Yusuke was gonna be a Journeys Righteous Devil stylist, and they\u2019d both have been relatively young dimwits that Genkai recruited/took under her wing to keep them from doing anything too stupid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":